  "prefLabel": "Mavs 103.09 Veterans Council",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mavs 103.09 Veterans Council. The veterans council shall serve as an advisory body and shall provide advice and guidance to the adjutant general regarding the delivery of services to veterans, military service members, and their families.\n\nSource. #13459-A, eff 10-14-22",
